Separately run network services (AGPL-3.0)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The web tools runtime runs the following programs as separate containers. They
are independent programs that communicate with this software only over the
network. They are not part of this software, are not licensed under FSL, and
remain under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3.

Firecrawl
  Image ghcr.io/agentifiers/firecrawl, built from the fork at
  https://github.com/Agentifiers/firecrawl. Corresponding source for each
  image is the fork release tagged v<version> for the image's <version> tag,
  the commit its org.opencontainers.image.revision label records
  (infrastructure/images/firecrawl/Dockerfile pins the image).

Firecrawl Playwright service
  Unmodified ghcr.io/firecrawl/playwright-service image, published from
  https://github.com/firecrawl/firecrawl (apps/playwright-service-ts).

Lightpanda
  Unmodified lightpanda/browser image. https://github.com/lightpanda-io/browser

SearXNG
  Unmodified searxng/searxng image. https://github.com/searxng/searxng
